      "en_US": [
        "Today’s Tuesday.\r",
        "That means the Bug-Catching Contest is\n",
        "on today.\r",
        "The rules are simple.\r",
        "Using one of your Pokémon, catch a\n",
        "Bug-type Pokémon to be judged.\r",
        "Would you like to give it a try?{YESNO 0}"
