    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "The Bug-Catching Contest is held on\n",
        "Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday.\r",
        "Not only do you earn a prize just for\n",
        "participating, you also get to keep the\f",
        "last bug Pokémon you caught."
      ]
    },
