    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "Your party’s full, so {STRVAR_1 1, 5, 0} was\n",
        "sent to your Box in Bill’s PC.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "We’ll return the Pokémon we kept for\n",
        "you. Here you go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "Don: Got it? I’m going to win! Don’t\n",
        "bother me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "Don: Luck plays a big part in this.\r",
        "You never know if Pokémon will\n",
        "appear."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00050",
      "en_US": [
        "Don: You won? The winner is you!?\r",
        "I’m so jealous... It’d be fantastic\n",
        "to be the winner..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "Ed: My PARASECT makes Pokémon fall\n",
        "asleep with Spore."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00052",
      "en_US": [
        "Ed: You can’t win with Pokémon that are\n",
        "run down or low on HP."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "Ed: I envy you. I just couldn’t do it\n",
        "this time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "Abby: I’ve been training Pokémon that\n",
        "inflict status problems for\f",
        "this contest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00055",
      "en_US": [
        "Abby: I heard that using Pokémon with\n",
        "beautiful colors makes it easier to win.\f",
        "I wonder if that’s true?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00056",
      "en_US": [
        "Abby: Wonderful! You sparkle and gleam\n",
        "right now. You really do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "William: Winning? I’m more interested in\n",
        "finding rare Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00058",
      "en_US": [
        "William: Well, I’m satisfied because\n",
        "I caught a Pokémon I wanted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00059",
      "en_US": [
        "William: You’re the winner? What did you\n",
        "catch? Show me, show me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00060",
      "en_US": [
        "Benny: ...... ...... ......\n",
        "...... ...... Ssssh!\r",
        "You’ll scare off SCYTHER.\n",
        "I’ll talk to you later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00061",
      "en_US": [
        "Benny: Listen, I caught a SCYTHER\n",
        "before, but I didn’t win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00062",
      "en_US": [
        "Benny: I just came to see how things\n",
        "were going today, you know?\r",
        "I’ll really try my best next time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00063",
      "en_US": [
        "Barry: You should weaken bug Pokémon\n",
        "first, then throw a Poké Ball."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00064",
      "en_US": [
        "Barry: It’s easier to win if you get a\n",
        "high-level bug Pokémon. But I think\f",
        "they also consider some other points."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00065",
      "en_US": [
        "Barry: That Pokémon you caught...\n",
        "It’s awesome!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00066",
      "en_US": "Cindy: I really love bug Pokémon!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00067",
      "en_US": [
        "Cindy: I really love bug Pokémon!\r",
        "Did I already say that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00068",
      "en_US": [
        "Cindy: Congratulations on winning!\n",
        "By the way...\r",
        "Did I mention that I really love bug\n",
        "Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00069",
      "en_US": [
        "Josh: I’ve been collecting bug Pokémon\n",
        "since I was just a baby.\r",
        "There’s no way I’m going to lose!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00070",
      "en_US": [
        "Josh: I heard that somebody won with a\n",
        "CATERPIE!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00071",
      "en_US": [
        "Josh: It’s called a Bug-Catching\n",
        "Contest, not a Bird-Catching Contest!\r",
        "You, of all people, should know that.\n",
        "After all, you won!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00072",
      "en_US": [
        "Samuel: What?\n",
        "If you’ve got the time to chat, go find\f",
        "some bug Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00073",
      "en_US": [
        "Samuel: So... I thought I would\n",
        "score higher..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00074",
      "en_US": [
        "Samuel: It’s so disappointing...\n",
        "I won’t forget this defeat, and..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00075",
      "en_US": [
        "Kipp: I’ve studied bug Pokémon a lot.\n",
        "I’m going to win for sure."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00076",
      "en_US": [
        "Kipp: I study a lot, but that’s not\n",
        "enough to win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0246_00077",
      "en_US": [
        "Kipp: Could you give me some tips?\n",
        "I want to win!"
